          <p>
            The Pro Elite chocolate panel lists a two-scoop serving with 30 g of protein, 180 calories, 4 g of fat including 1 g saturated, 5 g of carbohydrate with 3 g of fiber, and 0 g of total and added sugar, at the time of writing. The tub holds 27 servings in a 2.96 lb container. The protein comes from pea protein and pumpkin protein.
