          </p>

          <p>
            Against competitors, Pro Elite compares well. Garden of Life Sport Organic Plant-Based Protein, which adds USDA Organic and NSF Certified for Sport status, usually costs noticeably more per 25 g. Single-ingredient pea powders such as Naked Pea can cost less per gram but come unflavored and need blending. Flavored, ready-to-mix plant powders at 30 g per serving and around $1.50 per 25 g are uncommon.
          </p>

          <p>
            For a vegan lifter taking one shake a day, the difference between Pro Elite and a $2.50-per-25-g premium plant powder is around $25 to $30 a month. If you are not sure how much protein you need from shakes at all, start with our <a href="/how-much-protein-do-i-need/">protein needs guide</a>.
          </p>
