          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            OWYN is best known for its grocery-store shakes, but its best product is a tub. Pro Elite Protein Powder gives you 30 g of allergy-friendly pea and pumpkin protein with zero sugar for about $1.55 per 25 g of protein at list price, which is hard to beat among flavored plant powders. The original powder and shakes are fine, but they cost more per gram and, in the original versions, add a little cane sugar.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
